package omp 4
using multi-threaded neighbor list subroutines
# LAMMPS Stage 3: Parallel Equilibration (CHARMM)
# Full CHARMM: 1-4 terms in the dihedrals, arithmetic mixing, NBFIX, PPPM.

units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     charmm
dihedral_style  charmmfsw
improper_style  harmonic
special_bonds   charmm
pair_style      lj/charmmfsw/coul/long 10.0 12.0
Switching to CHARMM coulomb energy conversion constant (src/KSPACE/pair_lj_charmmfsw_coul_long.cpp:63)

read_data       system_ramped.data
